  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRC, Humane, dignified, sustainable migration and return programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRK, Program f&#xf6;r human, v&#xe4;rdig, h&#xe5;llbar migration och &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att bidra till en &#xf6;kad v&#xe4;rdighet och ett st&#xe4;rkt skydd f&#xf6;r migranter, l&#xe4;ngs migrationsrutter och vid &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande, samt till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade levnadsvillkor f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndare och v&#xe4;rdsamh&#xe4;llen. Insatsen ska bidra till detta l&#xe5;ngsiktiga m&#xe5;l genom f&#xf6;ljande programm&#xe5;l: 1) Ett holistiskt och inkluderande st&#xf6;d inom migration st&#xe4;rker skyddet och v&#xe4;lbefinnandet f&#xf6;r migranter, &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndare och v&#xe4;rdsamh&#xe4;llen samt st&#xe4;rker en h&#xe5;llbar &#xe5;terintegrering av &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndare 2) St&#xe4;rkt kapacitet bland nationella och lokala akt&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r en principfast och m&#xe4;nniskocentrerad migrationshantering och migrationstj&#xe4;nster 3) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad samordning f&#xf6;r ett samst&#xe4;mmigt, relevant och flexibelt st&#xf6;d till migranter och &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndare, som &#xe4;r behovs&#xac; och r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserat 4) Migrationssystem styrs av evidens och internationella m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r principfast verksamhet
Insatsen kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras av Svenska R&#xf6;da Korset genom R&#xf6;da Kors- och Halvm&#xe5;ner&#xf6;relsen i Etiopien, Irak, Libanon, Syrien och Turkiet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the proposed program is to contribute to improved dignity and protection for migrants, along the migratory routes and upon return, as well as improved living conditions for returnees and host communities.  The overall goals is underpinned by the following program objectives: 
Objective 1: Holistic and inclusive migration support strengthens the protection and well-being of migrants, returnees and host communities, and sustainable reintegration of returnees.
Objective 2: Strengthened capacities of national and local actors in principled and people-centered migration management and services.
Objective 3: Enhanced coordination for coherent, relevant and flexible support to migrants and returnees based on needs and informed by rights.
Objective 4: Migration systems are guided by evidence and international human rights and enable principled operations.
The contribution will be implemented by the Swedish Red Cross through the Red Cross and Red Crescent Movement in Ethiopia, Iraq, Lebanon, Syria, and Turkey.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the program is to contribute to improved dignity and protection for migrants, along the migratory routes and upon return, as well as improved living conditions for returnees and host communities.  

This goal is underpinned by the following objectives:

Objective 1: Holistic and inclusive migration support strengthens the protection and well-being of migrants, returnees and host communities, and sustainable reintegration of returnees.
Objective 2: Strengthened capacities of national and local actors in principled and people-centered migration management and services.
Objective 3: Enhanced coordination for coherent, relevant and flexible support to migrants and returnees based on needs and informed by rights.
Objective 4: Migration systems are guided by evidence and international human rights and enable principled operations.</narrative>
  </description>
